    "title": "第2章 新星らの台頭",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 2: The Rise of the New Stars",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "レースを観戦した数日後。トレーナー室で事務作業をしていると、\nノックの音が聞こえてきた。",
            "enText": "Several days had passed since I watched the race. \nAs I was busy with administrative tasks in my office, I heard a knock at the door.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "はい、どうぞ！",
                    "enText": "Yes, come in!",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2024055278350570596,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "し、失礼します……。\nお疲れさまです、トレーナーさん。",
            "enText": "E-Excuse me… \nGood work today, Trainer.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 139,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あれ、この間の！今日はどうしたんだ？",
                    "enText": "Oh, it's you! What can I do for you today?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "あれ、この間の！今日はどうしたの？",
                    "enText": "Oh, it's you! What can I do for you today?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": -2285739148600170658
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 5022133203882717605
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5162202488282029131,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ええと、あの……\n東京レース場ではすみませんでした……！",
            "enText": "Um, well… \nI'm so sorry for what happened at Tokyo Racecourse…!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 197,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -2344775448294669204
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5092295192800914937
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5975539695042180102,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "広報委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "PR Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "心配をかけたり、栄養食まで……なので、今日はその謝罪と……\nお礼と言うにはささやかなのですが、もつ煮込みを作ってきました。",
            "enText": "After causing you concern and even taking food from you… \nI'm here today to apologize. Also… it's a humble gesture, but I've brought some <i>motsu-nikomi</i> I cooked myself.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 410,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "も、もつ煮を？わざわざ？",
                    "enText": "<i>M-Motsu-nikomi</i>? Just for me?",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 4129264113715354050
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": -6157840156087266400
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5507212589849577752,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女の義理堅さに驚きつつ……早速、まだ温かいそれをいただく。\n――美味しい！　塩味のバランスが完璧だった。",
            "enText": "Surprised by her strong sense of duty, I immediately dig into the still-warm dish. —It's delicious! The balance of saltiness is perfect.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ありがとう！……ええと、名前は……",
                    "enText": "Thank you! …Um, and your name is…?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 174,
                    "pathId": -8336741672979175293
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 6893468101938888689
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3532839074188482442,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……クロノジェネシスと申します。\n一応、広報委員を務めております……。",
            "enText": "Ah… My name is Chrono Genesis. I'm currently a member of the Public Relations Committee…… for the time being.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 196,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノジェネシス……あ、そういえば",
                    "enText": "Chrono Genesis… Ah, that reminds me",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 169,
                    "pathId": 176375563635489332
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9137073029473030830,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "先日判明したことだが、自分が好きなコラム『徒然、歴史語り』を\n書いていたのは彼女だった。つまり、今目の前にいるのは――",
            "enText": "It was only revealed the other day, but she was the one who wrote my favorite column, \"Tsurezure, Rekishi-gatari\" In other words, the person standing before me is—",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ライターCさん！貴方のコラム大好きです！",
                    "enText": "<i>Writer C</i>! I absolutely love your column!",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 169,
                    "pathId": -6157886573898673726
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1460822272882501254,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "わ！　そ、そんな……！\nあれは、ただの備忘録で……！",
            "enText": "Wha! N-Not at all…! \nThose are just my personal memos…!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 143,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -2806021690729968263
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5229265727373897685
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3815553469193893967,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "で、でも、その……嬉しいです。\nそんなふうに、言ってくださって……。",
            "enText": "B-But, um… I'm happy. \nThat you would say something like that…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 236,
                    "pathId": 2906152490085229435
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": -1575195173349986064
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1360093357660378280,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "なんというか、はい……本当に、趣味としてのアレですから……\nなので、誰にも読まれていないと思っていたんですけど……。",
            "enText": "How should I put it… yes… it's really just a hobby for me… \nSo, I figured no one was actually reading it…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなことない！……証拠を見せようか？",
                    "enText": "That's not true at all! …Want proof?",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなことないよ！……証拠を見せようか？",
                    "enText": "That's not true at all! …Want proof?",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": -3700152099412435192
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3477884642979548343
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6005721736566095373,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "特に面白かったコラムを切り抜き、スクラップしているファイルを\n持ってくる。最近だとセントライトの回も最高だったと伝えたら――",
            "enText": "I bring over a file where I've clipped and scrapped the columns I found particularly interesting. When I tell her that her recent piece on the <i>St. Lite</i> was also fantastic—",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 8826342116842753791
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 156,
                    "pathId": 8445365873591668747
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7414731754738383692,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えっ、こんなに――……あ、ありがとう、ございます……！\nえっと、その……私……。",
            "enText": "Eh, this much—? …Th-Thank you so much…! \nUm, well… I…",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 329,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -4264383634563344848
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 699887642963725468
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -962890534830965921,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "が、頑張りますね。これからも……――ふふっ。",
            "enText": "I'll keep doing my best then. From now on, too… —Ehehe.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 1482956062126842950
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5778027944501757531,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そんなことがあった、数日後。\n模擬レースを観ていると、そこに彼女の姿を見つけた。",
            "enText": "A few days after that encounter. \nWhile watching a practice race, I spotted her there.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": -2382166605606890406
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8152279170058815084,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "グランアレグリア",
            "enName": "Gran Alegria",
            "jpText": "おはマイルー！　今日はよろしくねっ。\nラヴちゃん、クロノちゃん！",
            "enText": "Good Mile-ning! \nLet's have a great one today, Love, Chrono!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 148,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": -8710062179876716080
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 46,
                    "pathId": -6064178257735987386
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": -9060748524168442006
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 203,
                    "pathId": -6979287603510938992
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 310,
                    "pathId": 642654574688358886
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7762214918673740783,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ラヴズオンリーユー",
            "enName": "Loves Only You",
            "jpText": "ふふっ。ええ、よろしく二人とも。\n今日の配信でコミュメンに勝利報告をするのは私よ♡",
            "enText": "Hehe. Yes, I'm looking forward to it, both of you. I'll be the one reporting a victory to my followers in today's stream♡",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 261,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 207,
                    "pathId": -5120437646737116097
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 4884129171912381430
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 7233155315964758488
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6138796374387044944
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 311,
                    "pathId": -5406535005471119932
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 7393734836708722417
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6549346560341640787,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "よ、よろしくお願いいたします……。\n私も、精一杯やらせていただきますね。",
            "enText": "I-I look forward to working with you both… \nI will do my absolute best as well.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 217,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 276,
                    "pathId": -3028427985623327789
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 205,
                    "pathId": -5758808046374149149
                },
