            "pathId": -8779708400971022834,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……コースの状態は良。第2、第3コーナーまで距離がある関係で、\n先行争いは激しくならない。9人立て。逃げ予想は1人――",
            "enText": "…Track condition is firm. Given the distance to the second and third corners, the battle for positioning shouldn't be too intense. Nine runners in total. I predict only one lead runner—",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 373,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 276,
                    "pathId": 5639607562545888312
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 205,
                    "pathId": 8128213591937649331
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": -1327053241249421556
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": 2151245613072981943
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -265680085802799797
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3532467738252651203,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "恐らく、ペースはスロー……符合するレースはいくつかある。\nあとは展開から、より近いものを割り出して……。",
            "enText": "Chances are, it'll be a slow pace… I can think of a few past races that fit these conditions. From there, I'll work out the most likely development…",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 263,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": -9135086279421439606
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2938331802102613230,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イベント実況",
            "enName": "Event Announcer",
            "jpText": "模擬レース、芝1800m……\nいま一斉にスタートです！",
            "enText": "Mock race, 1800m on turf… \nand they're off, a clean start for everyone!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
