        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（大丈夫。まだ追わなくていい。\n歴史が証明してる。勝てる位置で仕掛ける！）",
            "enText": "(It's okay. I don't need to chase yet. History proves it. I'll make my move from a winning position!)",
            "nextBlock": 30,
