        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……色んな意味で、クロノジェネシスから目が離せない。\n考えられたペース配分。キレのある末脚。勝利への執念――",
            "enText": "…For many reasons, I can't take my eyes off Chrono Genesis. Her calculated pace management. Her sharp final burst. Her tenacity for victory—",
